  "contentHtml": "<p><span>재과만 선생님들이 올려주셨던 영상들이 대부분입니다. ^^</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>교과서에는 없지만, 구름을 배운 우리는 이 정도는 알고 넘어가자. 라며 시작하였습니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span>1. 구름의 이름&#160;</span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3SNIDtZsTUA\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">(63) EBS 클립뱅크(Clipbank) - 다양한 구름의 이름(Various Names of Clouds) - YouTube</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3SNIDtZsTUA\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"640\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dCnsVk/hyNR97OVEY/DkIL7nxIgmXEHyLlv9FFpk/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=480&amp;face=0_0_640_480\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"640\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3SNIDtZsTUA\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 3월 19일 동부간선로에서 찍은 사진을 보여주며&#160;</p><p>&#160; &#160; - 너희가 볼수 있는 구름 종류 마음속으로 생각해보자.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83ddc0e8b498ed44ed772821fe21269b86805fd1\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"575\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83ddc0e8b498ed44ed772821fe21269b86805fd1\" data-origin-width=\"1282\" data-origin-height=\"961\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>3. 문화포털 층운&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LUnT_XJOA18\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LUnT_XJOA18</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f297850ebdd6ec74c715696dc9644d5dc9c67686\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"402\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f297850ebdd6ec74c715696dc9644d5dc9c67686\" data-origin-width=\"1516\" data-origin-height=\"857\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>기상청 구름 정리 영상 (이건 코로나로 인해 수업을 못하신 선생님 보강자료로 사용했습니다. )</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XbA9jFgEOdU\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">(63) [기상청 날씨공부] 3강 구름 - YouTube</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XbA9jFgEOdU\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"640\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Dabbk/hyNScKfdYY/q9m45ypPJwdX8jDEnLLdhK/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=480&amp;face=475_113_510_152\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"640\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XbA9jFgEOdU\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
